&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBJBBT242pD1AHFO5QNBXGQVlVwtCGnWc0Z3fTFy0mMA&oe=6AFC7337"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "3306346616169973", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310827_3306346622836639_5645990380599859009_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4XKh2lp0890Q7kNvwEyG46T&_nc_oc=Adp7FBAQaeGkZs4wTxJQhPwD0JL-5KEYmtUO7RFq8vDNlfgfJoNeC6yo57M3xXfG_NY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnkLRY6qjCWymM1jJjdmxHHcXmfMApZmknxpu8DpMc6g&oe=6AFC81E9"}, "display_name": "Forge of Elements", "keywords": ["Cozy", "Relaxing", "Puzzle", "Crafting", "Creative"], "long_description": "Combine elements to discover new creations and breathe life into enchanting worlds.\n\nAs you experiment with different combinations, watch your world transform from a blank canvas into vibrant, living landscape.\n\n**Combine and Create** \n\n{2576554876034717}\n\nMix elements to unlock new creations and bring the world in front of you to life.\n\n**Themed Realms** \n\n{1503568004012607}\n\nWith multiple themed realms, each with their own story, watch them flourish from a blank canvas into a bustling, living landscape.\n\n**Unlock & Discover** \n\n{972357928379025}\n\nExperiment freely with over 100 elements and combinations to discover.\n\n**Relaxing Puzzle Gameplay**\n\nPlay seated or standing with stress-free, intuitive puzzles designed for both hand tracking and controllers.", "short_description": "Combine elements to discover new creations and breathe life into enchanting worlds. Experiment as your empty realms grow into vibrant, living landscapes."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fovrinteractive.net/projects/forge-of-elements/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FoVR Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fovri